      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window (exactly k = at most k - at most k-1)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/subarrays-with-k-different-integers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 992</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Subarrays with K Different Integers</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">\"Exactly k distinct\" has no single window, because both too few and too many are invalid. \"At most k distinct\" does: its valid starts for each end form a suffix. So answer = atMost(k) - atMost(k - 1), two windows with a count array. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
